OL,5,G2000 The World In A Painting: Manet's
OL,6,G     Lamps
OL,7,     FIn the twilight of his life,
OL,8,     FEdouard Manet began the creation
OL,9,     Fof his final masterpiece: A Bar at
OL,10,     Fthe Folies-Bergere.
OL,11,G2115 Art Traffickers: Treasures Stolen
OL,12,G     from the Tombs
OL,13,     FThrough a combination of
OL,14,     Finterviews and studio
OL,15,     Freconstructions, recount the
OL,16,     Fgripping stories behind those who
OL,17,     Fhave excavated and stolen
OL,18,     Fmasterpieces. (2 of 4)
